/v/t64.5771-25/39031545_1695566271189918_7563581897204183653_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H_5yYiEhTCEQ7kNvwFmnI9B&_nc_oc=AdkBSXEDFNkEx819ZDSEAXUipjU_sBlH2y6cqJH4UNYUKwNMd7dJ7exjJMo5kcl7vEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Aft4ZoCpOnK0xrr3gZgv_OEUIlMKrSZcGdZWOYBlRhsBhQ&oe=699994BC"}, {"file_name": "ss4.png", "id": "3751167238508534", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001725_3751167241841867_2951941851866511973_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dk52zG_bu-AQ7kNvwErmdkH&_nc_oc=Adkc2OcUT-cJjkEBZe1T7lq0tFVyXYbtocMppjyr_G0TJEPsWMoj-qHhL5eNf7F-ZVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afs2Fg6beOvAsUGeour1wTSgaQF563_1NkJRrVAYCjdB3Q&oe=69999D5D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1691892224915749", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75580056_1691892228249082_8993988736869608245_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nLEToZEkLJoQ7kNvwF20xt5&_nc_oc=Adk-P1muwBjIZVDZNQOyNEpTVYZOokcUhJR8MFhUhwTUphcDtnXt_a3rBLn2VSXfHh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsjP5OeeXfFzkr5vBOy5Ezpno599dlrdUbOYB6Olt-c6w&oe=69999EDA"}, "display_name": "Stealthy Swipers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Description:\nImmerse yourself in the thrilling world of \"Stealthy Swipers,\" a cutting-edge VR game where your mission is to \"borrow\" valuable items from a vast, high-tech environment while evading detection by the colossal room owner. This game combines intense stealth mechanics, strategic gameplay, and a rich, futuristic setting to deliver an unforgettable virtual reality experience.\n\nGame Features:\n\n    Immersive VR Environment:\n        Experience a meticulously crafted, enormous space brought to life with state-of-the-art VR graphics. The game environment is designed to be visually stunning and deeply immersive, making you feel like you are truly inside a high-tech, futuristic world.\n\n    